#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:60
msgid ""
"Basic joint-space control sets joint targets directly on the actuators. For "
"joint-space impedance control, use :class:`JointImpedanceController` (see "
"`Joint-space controllers`_)."
msgstr ""
"基本的关节空间控制直接向执行器设置关节目标。关节空间阻抗控制可使用 :class:`JointImpedanceController` ，见 "
"`关节空间控制器 <Joint-space controllers_>`_。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:64
msgid ""
"Start with differential IK for reaching or teleoperation with position-"
"controlled actuators. Choose OSC when you need torque commands, task-space "
"compliance, or simultaneous motion and contact force control. For example, "
"wiping a table requires motion along its surface while maintaining a force "
"normal to it."
msgstr ""
"使用位置控制执行器进行到达目标或遥操作时，可以先选用微分 IK。需要输出力矩指令、实现任务空间柔顺性，或同时控制运动和接触力时，可选用 "
"OSC。例如，擦拭桌面时，需要沿桌面运动，同时维持沿桌面法向的接触力。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:69
msgid ""
"The :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` and :doc:`OSC walkthrough "
"<../how-to/run_osc>` provide complete scenes, state extraction, and runnable"
" demonstrations. Both tutorial scripts use Isaac Sim PhysX and require an "
"Isaac Sim installation."
msgstr ""
":doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 和 :doc:`OSC 教程 <../how-to/run_osc>` "
"提供了完整场景、状态提取方法和可运行的演示。两个教程脚本均使用 Isaac Sim PhysX，需要安装 Isaac Sim。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:79
msgid ""
"Franka arms on stands with coordinate-frame markers at their end effectors."
msgstr "安装在支架上的 Franka 机械臂，末端执行器处显示坐标系标记。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:82
msgid ""
"**IK: reach a pose.** Each arm tracks an end-effector goal through joint "
