msgstr ""
"**IK：到达目标位姿。** 每条机械臂通过关节位置目标跟踪末端执行器的目标位姿。运行 :doc:`IK 演示 <../how-"
"to/run_diff_ik>` ，可以观察实际位姿与目标位姿的坐标系标记逐渐重合。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:88
msgid ""
"Franka arms touching translucent red tilted walls with their fingertips."
msgstr "Franka 机械臂用指尖接触半透明的红色倾斜墙面。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:91
msgid ""
"**OSC: control motion and contact force.** The tilted-wall example commands "
"10 N along the wall normal while tracking pose in the other directions. "
":doc:`Run the OSC demonstration <../how-to/run_osc>`."
msgstr ""
"**OSC：控制运动和接触力。** 倾斜墙面示例沿墙面法向施加 10 N 的目标力，同时在其他方向上跟踪目标位姿。详见 :doc:`OSC 演示 "
"<../how-to/run_osc>` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:98
msgid "The control loop"
msgstr "控制循环"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:100
msgid ""
"The IK and OSC instances compute targets from state supplied by the caller; "
"they do not read the simulation or submit actuator commands. "
":meth:`~DifferentialIKController.set_command` stores a goal until it is "
"replaced, and every control cycle reads fresh state, calls ``compute()``, "
"stages the targets, and steps the simulation; see :ref:`controller-api-"
"examples` for the loop from the IK walkthrough. IK targets are joint "
"positions that the configured position actuator tracks. OSC targets are "
"joint efforts, so configure zero actuator stiffness and damping to keep "
"actuator feedback from adding to them."
msgstr ""
"IK 和 OSC "
"控制器根据调用者提供的状态计算目标值，不会自行读取仿真状态或向执行器发送指令。:meth:`~DifferentialIKController.set_command`"
" 保存目标，直到下一次设置将其替换。每个控制周期都需要读取最新状态、调用 ``compute()``、写入目标，再推进仿真；IK 教程中的循环见 "
":ref:`controller-api-examples` 。IK 输出关节位置目标，由配置的位置执行器跟踪。OSC "
"输出关节力/力矩目标，因此应将执行器刚度和阻尼设为零，避免执行器的反馈控制额外叠加力/力矩。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:109
msgid ""
"Keep the command, end-effector pose, and Jacobian in a consistent coordinate"
" frame. The tutorials use the suffix ``_b`` for the robot base frame and "
"``_w`` for the world frame; these names do not transform the data. Absolute "
"poses contain position followed by a quaternion in ``(x, y, z, w)`` order. "
"For OSC, commands and axis selections can use a separate task frame, while "
"state passed to ``compute()`` remains in the base frame."
msgstr ""
"指令、末端执行器位姿和雅可比矩阵必须使用一致的坐标系。教程用后缀 ``_b`` 表示机器人基座坐标系，用 ``_w`` "
"表示世界坐标系；变量名称本身不会变换数据。绝对位姿由位置和四元数组成，四元数采用 ``(x, y, z, w)`` 顺序。OSC "
"的指令和控制轴选择可以使用单独的任务坐标系，但传入 ``compute()`` 的状态仍须在基座坐标系下表示。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:117
msgid "Joint-space controllers"
msgstr "关节空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:119
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated configuration class for selecting a joint-space "
"control mode. Instead, the control mode follows from which targets you set "
"through ``articulation.actuators``: effort targets for torque control, "
"velocity targets for velocity control, and position targets for position "
"control. See :ref:`actuators-runtime-api` for the runtime API."
msgstr ""
"没有专门用于选择关节空间控制模式的配置类。控制模式取决于通过 ``articulation.actuators`` "
"设置哪些目标：驱动力目标对应力矩控制，速度目标对应速度控制，位置目标对应位置控制。运行时 API 见 :ref:`actuators-runtime-"
"api` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:125
msgid "Torque control"
msgstr "力矩控制"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:127
#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:140
#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:160
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"n\"`` （关节数量）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:129
msgid ""
"In torque control mode, the input actions are directly set as feed-forward "
"joint torque commands, i.e. at every time-step,"
msgstr "在扭矩控制模式下，输入动作被直接设置为前馈关节扭矩命令，即在每个时间步，"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:132
msgid "\\tau = \\tau_{des}"
msgstr "\\tau = \\tau_{des}"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:138
msgid "Velocity control"
msgstr "速度控制"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:142
msgid ""
"In velocity control mode, a proportional control law is required to reduce "
"the error between the current and desired joint velocities. Based on input "
"actions, the joint torques commands are computed as:"
msgstr "在速度控制模式下，需要一个比例控制律来减少当前与期望关节速度之间的误差。基于输入动作，关节扭矩命令计算如下:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:145
msgid "\\tau = k_d (\\dot{q}_{des} - \\dot{q})"
msgstr "\\tau = k_d (\\dot{q}_{des} - \\dot{q})"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:149
msgid "where :math:`k_d` are the gains parsed from configuration."
msgstr "在这里 :math:`k_d` 是从配置中解析得到的增益。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:153
msgid ""
"While performing velocity control, in many cases, gravity compensation is "
"required to ensure better tracking of the command. In this case, we suggest "
"disabling gravity for the links in the articulation in simulation."
msgstr "在执行速度控制时，在许多情况下，需要进行重力补偿以确保更好地跟踪命令。在这种情况下，我们建议在仿真中禁用关节中链节的重力。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:158
msgid "Position control with fixed impedance"
msgstr "位置控制与固定阻抗"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:162
msgid ""
"In position control mode, a proportional-damping (PD) control law is "
"employed to track the desired joint positions and ensuring the articulation "
"remains still at the desired location (i.e., desired joint velocities are "
"zero). Based on the input actions, the joint torque commands are computed "
"as:"
msgstr ""
"在位置控制模式下，采用比例-阻尼 (PD) "
"控制律来跟踪期望的关节位置，并确保关节保持在期望位置（即期望的关节速度为零）。根据输入动作，关节扭矩命令计算如下:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:166
msgid "\\tau = k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q}"
msgstr "\\tau = k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q}"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:170
msgid ""
"where :math:`k_p` and :math:`k_d` are the gains parsed from configuration."
msgstr "其中 :math:`k_p` 和 :math:`k_d` 是从配置中解析出的增益。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:172
msgid ""
"A more complete formulation which considers the dynamics of the articulation"
" would be:"
msgstr "考虑关节体动力学后，更完整的表达式为："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:174
msgid "\\tau = M \\left( k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q} \\right) + g"
msgstr "\\tau = M \\left( k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q} \\right) + g"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:178
msgid ""
"where :math:`M` is the joint-space inertia matrix of size :math:`n \\times "
"n`, and :math:`g` is the joint-space gravity vector. This implementation is "
"available through the :class:`JointImpedanceController` class by setting the"
" impedance mode to ``\"fixed\"``. The gains :math:`k_p` are parsed from the "
"input configuration and :math:`k_d` are computed while considering the "
"system as a decoupled point-mass oscillator, i.e.,"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`M` 是大小为 :math:`n \\times n` 的关节空间惯性矩阵， :math:`g` "
"是关节空间重力向量。通过将阻抗模式设置为 ``\"fixed\"`` ，可以通过 :class:`JointImpedanceController` "
"类来实现此功能。增益 :math:`k_p` 从输入配置中解析， :math:`k_d` 则在将系统视为解耦的点质量振荡器时计算得出，即，"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:183
msgid "k_d = 2 \\sqrt{k_p} \\times D"
msgstr "k_d = 2 \\sqrt{k_p} \\times D"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:187
msgid ""
"where :math:`D` is the damping ratio of the system. Critical damping is "
"achieved for :math:`D = 1`, overcritical damping for :math:`D > 1` and "
"undercritical damping for :math:`D < 1`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`D` 是系统的阻尼比。当 :math:`D = 1` 时，系统达到临界阻尼；当 :math:`D > 1` 时，系统为过阻尼；当 "
":math:`D < 1` 时，系统为欠阻尼。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:190
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is possible to disable the inertial or gravity compensation"
" in the controller by setting the flags :attr:`inertial_compensation` and  "
":attr:`gravity_compensation` in the configuration to :obj:`False`, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"此外，可以通过将配置中的标志 :attr:`inertial_compensation` 和 :attr:`gravity_compensation` "
"分别设置为 :obj:`False` 来禁用控制器中的惯性补偿或重力补偿。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:195
msgid "Position control with variable stiffness"
msgstr "位置控制与可变刚度"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:197
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"2n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"2n\"`` （关节数）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:199
msgid ""
"In stiffness control, the same formulation as above is employed, however, "
"the gains :math:`k_p` are part of the input commands. This implementation is"
" available through the :class:`JointImpedanceController` class by setting "
"the impedance mode to ``\"variable_kp\"``."
msgstr ""
"在刚度控制中，采用与上述相同的公式，然而，增益 :math:`k_p` 是输入命令的一部分。此实现可以通过 "
":class:`JointImpedanceController` 类实现，方法是将阻抗模式设置为 ``\"variable_kp\"`` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:204
msgid "Position control with variable impedance"
msgstr "位置控制与可变阻抗"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:206
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"3n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"3n\"`` （关节数）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:208
msgid ""
"In impedance control, the same formulation as above is employed, however, "
"both :math:`k_p` and :math:`k_d` are part of the input commands. This "
"implementation is available through the :class:`JointImpedanceController` "
"class by setting the impedance mode to ``\"variable\"``."
msgstr ""
"在阻抗控制中，采用与上述相同的公式，然而， :math:`k_p` 和 :math:`k_d` 都是输入命令的一部分。通过将阻抗模式设置为 "
"``\"variable\"`` ，可以通过 :class:`JointImpedanceController` 类来实现此功能。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:213
msgid "Task-space controllers"
msgstr "任务空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:216
msgid "Differential inverse kinematics (IK)"
msgstr "微分逆运动学 (IK)"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:218
msgid ""
"Action dimensions:  ``\"3\"`` (relative/absolute position), ``\"6\"`` "
"(relative pose), or ``\"7\"`` (absolute pose)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"3\"`` （相对/绝对位置）， ``\"6\"`` （相对姿态），或 ``\"7\"`` （绝对姿态）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:220
msgid ""
"Inverse kinematics converts the task-space tracking error to joint-space "
"error. In its most typical implementation, the pose error in the task-space,"
" :math:`\\Delta \\chi_e = (\\Delta p_e, \\Delta \\phi_e)`, is computed as "
"the Cartesian distance between the desired and current task-space positions,"
" and the shortest distance in :math:`\\mathbb{SO}(3)` between the desired "
"and current task-space orientations."
msgstr ""
"逆运动学将任务空间中的跟踪误差转换为关节空间误差。最常见的实现先计算任务空间位姿误差 :math:`\\Delta \\chi_e = (\\Delta"
" p_e, \\Delta \\phi_e)` ：位置误差为目标位置与当前位置之间的笛卡尔距离，姿态误差为目标姿态与当前姿态在 "
":math:`\\mathbb{SO}(3)` 中的最短距离。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:225
msgid ""
"Using the geometric Jacobian :math:`J_{eO} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{6 \\times n}`, "
"that relates task-space velocity to joint-space velocities, we design the "
"control law to obtain the desired joint positions as:"
msgstr ""
"使用几何雅可比矩阵 :math:`J_{eO} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{6 \\times n}` "
"，它将任务空间的速度与关节空间的速度关联起来，我们设计控制律以获得期望的关节位置，如下所示:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:228
msgid "q_{des} = q + \\eta J_{eO}^{-} \\Delta \\chi_e"
msgstr "q_{des} = q + \\eta J_{eO}^{-} \\Delta \\chi_e"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:232
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\eta` is a scaling parameter and :math:`J_{eO}^{-}` is the "
"pseudo-inverse of the Jacobian."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\eta` 是一个缩放参数，而 :math:`J_{eO}^{-}` 是雅可比矩阵的伪逆。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:234
msgid ""
"It is possible to compute the pseudo-inverse of the Jacobian using different"
" formulations:"
msgstr "可以使用不同的公式计算雅可比矩阵的伪逆:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:236
msgid ""
"Moore-Penrose pseudo-inverse (``\"pinv\"``): :math:`A^{-} = A^T(AA^T)^{-1}`."
msgstr "Moore–Penrose 伪逆（``\"pinv\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T(AA^T)^{-1}` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:237
msgid ""
"Levenberg-Marquardt pseudo-inverse (damped least-squares, ``\"dls\"``): "
":math:`A^{-} = A^T (AA^T + \\lambda^2 \\mathbb{I})^{-1}`."
msgstr ""
"Levenberg–Marquardt 伪逆（阻尼最小二乘法，``\"dls\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T (AA^T + "
"\\lambda^2 \\mathbb{I})^{-1}` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:239
msgid "Transpose pseudo-inverse (``\"trans\"``): :math:`A^{-} = A^T`."
msgstr "转置法（``\"trans\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:240
msgid ""
"Adaptive singular-value decomposition (SVD) pseudo-inverse (``\"svd\"``) "
"from :cite:t:`buss2004ik`."
msgstr "自适应奇异值分解（SVD）伪逆（``\"svd\"``），见 :cite:t:`buss2004ik` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:241
msgid ""
"Manipulability-aware damped least-squares (``\"adaptive_dls\"``): the "
"damping :math:`\\lambda` increases as the Jacobian approaches a singularity."
msgstr "考虑可操作度的阻尼最小二乘法（``\"adaptive_dls\"``）：雅可比矩阵接近奇异状态时，增大阻尼 :math:`\\lambda` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:244
msgid ""
"These implementations are available through the "
":class:`DifferentialIKController` class. See :doc:`../how-to/run_diff_ik` "
"for a runnable example."
msgstr ""
"这些实现通过 :class:`DifferentialIKController` 提供。可运行示例见 :doc:`../how-"
"to/run_diff_ik` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:248
msgid "Impedance controller"
msgstr "阻抗控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:250
msgid ""
"It uses task-space pose error and Jacobian to compute joint torques through "
"mass-spring-damper system with a) fixed stiffness, b) variable stiffness "
"(stiffness control), and c) variable stiffness and damping (impedance "
"control)."
msgstr ""
"它利用任务空间位姿误差和雅可比矩阵，通过质量–弹簧–阻尼系统计算关节力矩，支持 a) 固定刚度、b) 可变刚度（刚度控制），以及 c) "
"可变刚度和阻尼（阻抗控制）。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:255
msgid "Operational-space controller"
msgstr "操作空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:257
msgid ""
"Similar to task-space impedance control but uses the Equation of Motion "
"(EoM) for computing the task-space force. See :doc:`../how-to/run_osc` for a"
" runnable example."
msgstr "与任务空间阻抗控制类似，但使用运动方程（EoM）计算任务空间力。可运行示例见 :doc:`../how-to/run_osc` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:262
msgid "Closed-loop proportional force controller"
msgstr "闭环比例力控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:264
msgid ""
"It uses a proportional term to track the desired wrench command with respect"
" to current wrench at the end-effector."
msgstr "它根据末端执行器当前力旋量与目标力旋量的误差，通过比例项跟踪目标力/力矩指令。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:269
msgid "Hybrid force-motion controller"
msgstr "混合力-运动控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:271
msgid ""
"It combines closed-loop force control and operational-space motion control "
"to compute the desired wrench at the end-effector. It uses selection "
"matrices that define the unconstrained and constrained task directions."
msgstr "它结合闭环力控制和操作空间运动控制，计算末端执行器的目标力旋量，并用选择矩阵指定任务中不受约束和受约束的方向。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:280
msgid "Practical API examples"
msgstr "API 使用示例"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:283
msgid "Joint targets"
msgstr "关节目标"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:285
msgid ""
"These alternative command examples assume an initialized ``robot`` and "
"resolved ``arm_joint_ids``. Each target has shape ``(num_envs, "
"len(arm_joint_ids))``. Set position or velocity feedback gains in the "
"actuator configuration; for direct effort control, set actuator stiffness "
"and damping to zero. See :ref:`actuators-runtime-api` for the command API "
"and :doc:`actuators` for gains."
msgstr ""
"下面分别展示不同类型的指令，假定 ``robot`` 已初始化，且 ``arm_joint_ids`` 已解析。每个目标张量的形状均为 "
"``(num_envs, "
"len(arm_joint_ids))``。位置或速度反馈增益在执行器配置中设置；直接控制力/力矩时，应将执行器刚度和阻尼设为零。指令 API 见 "
":ref:`actuators-runtime-api` ，增益配置见 :doc:`actuators` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Velocity"
msgstr "速度"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Effort"
msgstr "力/力矩"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:319
msgid ""
"These calls stage and submit commands. Advance physics and update the scene "
"on each cycle as shown in :ref:`controller-control-loop`."
msgstr ""
"这些调用先写入待发送指令，再提交给仿真。每个周期还需要推进物理仿真并更新场景，见 :ref:`controller-control-loop` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:323
msgid "Task-space goals"
msgstr "任务空间目标"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:325
msgid ""
"The :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` resets the robot and "
"changes the goal every 150 steps. On intermediate steps, it reads fresh "
"state and computes joint position targets; every step applies the targets "
"and advances the simulation:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 每隔 150 "
"步重置机器人并更换目标。其余步读取最新状态并计算关节位置目标；每一步都会应用目标并推进仿真："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:329
msgid "scripts/tutorials/05_controllers/run_diff_ik.py"
msgstr "scripts/tutorials/05_controllers/run_diff_ik.py"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:336
msgid ""
"Relative commands also need the measured pose in "
":meth:`DifferentialIKController.set_command` to resolve the delta at command"
" time."
msgstr ""
"使用相对指令时，:meth:`DifferentialIKController.set_command` "
"还需要接收测得的位姿，以便在设置指令时解析相对增量。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:339
msgid ""
"An :class:`OperationalSpaceController` instance ``osc`` similarly stores its"
" motion/force goal with :meth:`OperationalSpaceController.set_command`, but "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.compute` returns efforts to stage with "
"``set_effort_index``. Its required state depends on the configured features."
" Use the :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` and :doc:`OSC "
"walkthrough <../how-to/run_osc>` for controller construction, state "
"extraction, and complete repeated loops."
msgstr ""
":class:`OperationalSpaceController` 实例 ``osc`` 同样通过 "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.set_command` 保存运动/力目标，但 "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.compute` 返回的是力/力矩，需要用 ``set_effort_index``"
" 写入。所需状态取决于启用的功能。控制器创建、状态提取和完整循环见 :doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 与 "
":doc:`OSC 教程 <../how-to/run_osc>` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:349
msgid "Reactive planners"
msgstr "反应式规划器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:351
msgid ""
"Typical task-space controllers do not account for motion constraints such as"
" joint limits, self-collision and environment collision. Instead they rely "
"on high-level planners (such as RRT) to handle these non-Euclidean "
"constraints and give joint/task-space way-points to the controller. However,"
" these methods are often conservative and have undesirable deceleration when"
" close to an object. More recently, different approaches combine the "
"constraints directly into an optimization problem, thereby providing a "
"holistic solution for motion generation and control."
msgstr ""
"典型的任务空间控制器并没有考虑诸如关节限制、自碰撞和环境碰撞等运动约束。相反，它们依赖于高级规划器（例如 RRT "
"）来处理这些非欧几里得约束，并将关节/任务空间的路径点传递给控制器。然而，这些方法通常比较保守，并且在靠近物体时会出现不理想的减速。最近，不同的方法将约束直接整合到优化问题中，从而为运动生成和控制提供了一个整体解决方案。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:361
msgid "Examples of reactive planners include:"
msgstr "反应式规划器的示例包括："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:363
msgid ""
"**RMPFlow (lula):** An acceleration-based policy that composes various "
"Reimannian Motion Policies (RMPs) to solve a hierarchy of tasks "
":cite:p:`cheng2021rmpflow`. It is capable of performing dynamic collision "
"avoidance while navigating the end-effector to a target."
msgstr ""
"**RMPFlow (lula):** 一种基于加速度的策略，通过组合各种黎曼运动策略（RMPs）来解决任务层次结构 "
":cite:p:`cheng2021rmpflow` 。它能够在将末端执行器导航到目标的同时执行动态避碰。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:367
msgid ""
"**MPC (OCS2):** A receding horizon control policy based on sequential "
"linear-quadratic (SLQ) programming. It formulates various constraints into a"
" single optimization problem via soft-penalties and uses automatic "
"differentiation to compute derivatives of the system dynamics, constraints "
"and costs. The MPC formulation for end-effector trajectory tracking in "
"fixed-arm and mobile manipulators described in "
":cite:p:`mittal2021articulated` considers a kinematic system model with "
"joint limits and self-collision avoidance. See the `OCS2 documentation "
"<https://leggedrobotics.github.io/ocs2/>`_ for the external toolbox and "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"**MPC（OCS2）：** "
"基于序贯线性二次（SLQ）规划的滚动时域控制策略。它通过软惩罚将各类约束纳入同一优化问题，并使用自动微分计算系统动力学、约束和代价的导数。 "
":cite:p:`mittal2021articulated` 中用于固定机械臂和移动操作机器人末端轨迹跟踪的 MPC "
"采用运动学系统模型，考虑关节限位和自碰撞规避。外部工具包和示例见 `OCS2 文档 "
"<https://leggedrobotics.github.io/ocs2/>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:377
msgid ""
":class:`RmpFlowController` wraps the CPU-based Lula bindings, so its "
"computation can limit throughput in large batches. It also needs the Lula "
"library and robot description files; these dependencies are separate from "
"the selected physics backend."
msgstr ""
":class:`RmpFlowController` 包装基于 CPU 的 Lula 绑定，因此大批量计算时可能限制吞吐量。它还需要 Lula "
"库和机器人描述文件；这些依赖与所选物理后端相互独立。"
